Law texts

The texts in this repository are Maharashtra Acts as reprinted, in English, by the Law and Judiciary Department,
Government of Maharashtra (lj.maharashtra.gov.in, "Reprint of the Act"). Each reprint gives the Act as modified up to
the date it states.

- Copyright: the Copyright Act, 1957, s. 52(1)(q), says that the following does not infringe copyright: "the
  reproduction or publication of ... (ii) any Act of a Legislature subject to the condition that such Act is
  reproduced or published together with any commentary thereon or any other original matter". This repository
  publishes each Act together with original matter of its own: the arrangement of the text as a git history, the
  amendment ledger in data/amendments.csv, the version data and the documentation.
- The department's website policy says: "Material featured on this website may be reproduced free of charge after
  taking proper permission by sending a mail to us. However, the material has to be reproduced accurately and not to
  be used in a derogatory manner or in a misleading context. Wherever the material is being published or issued to
  others, the source must be prominently acknowledged." The Act text is reproduced here under s. 52(1)(q)(ii) above;
  the source is acknowledged below and in every version's note.
- The reprints are not the authoritative text: the Acts as published in the Maharashtra Government Gazette are.

Attribution: Source: Law and Judiciary Department, Government of Maharashtra, https://lj.maharashtra.gov.in.

